  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together beurre monte, olive oil, garlic, thyme, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Arrange the scallop shells on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Place a slice of reblochon cheese in each scallop shell.",
    "Drizzle the beurre monte mixture over the cheese in each shell.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 10 minutes or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a minute or two before serving.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional thyme if desired."
  ],
